      "type": "blockquote",
      "source": "❗ **Important**: It’s an error to call this function multiple times for the same connection, or to call multiple functions that set code-signing requirements on the same connection.",
      "normalizedSource": "❗ **Important**: It’s an error to call this function multiple times for the same connection, or to call multiple functions that set code-signing requirements on the same connection.",
      "sourceHash": "1a4986479cd1180f96e10cd66aa6a39cc2a57dad49dcd25778e2485f10c2cdff",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "If your process sent a message to its peer expecting a reply, and its executable doesn’t have the requested entitlement, then you don’t receive a reply and the operating system delivers [`XPC_ERROR_PEER_CODE_SIGNING_REQUIREMENT`](xpc_error_peer_code_signing_requirement-c.macro.md) instead.",
